  // duration 152us(ours) vs 54us(FA4). Per-issue stall cycles ours->FA4: long_scoreboard(global load)
  // 4.1->3.0, barrier 3.0->2.1, wait 1.9->2.0, short_scoreboard(tmem/O-rescale) 0.33->0.89; DRAM 8%->20%.
